    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Neon Runners: Craft &amp; Dash \u2013 The Ultimate Racing &amp; Running Game!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get ready for an action-packed racing with simple controls!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compete in fast-paced running races, conquer stages, and defeat monsters in a thrilling sprint to victory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unleash your creativity in the Level Maker, share your designs, and challenge the world to fun, neon infused races!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2785860/extras/battleRacing.png?t=1744401370\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2785860/extras/34f5f3af4842c1c94ecc0fff996ce952.poster.avif?t=1744401370\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2785860/extras/34f5f3af4842c1c94ecc0fff996ce952.webm?t=1744401370\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2785860/extras/34f5f3af4842c1c94ecc0fff996ce952.mp4?t=1744401370\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is the core mode that defines <i>Neon Runners</i>: Four enter, but only one emerges victorious. Race against three opponents, each equipped with powerful abilities, and be the first to reach the goal. The courses are filled with game-changing power-ups and gimmicks that add excitement\u2014or chaos\u2014to the competition.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2785860/extras/762f2b2ed280293be96b6cb034857237.avif?t=1744401370\" width=650 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2785860/extras/0e779fbb183f81620b2533ff34ecc300.poster.avif?t=1744401370\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2785860/extras/0e779fbb183f81620b2533ff34ecc300.webm?t=1744401370\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2785860/extras/0e779fbb183f81620b2533ff34ecc300.mp4?t=1744401370\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Daily Contest</strong><br>Take on the ever-changing Daily Contest map to receive amazing rewards. <br>The greater your skills, the better the rewards that await you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stage Mode</strong><br>Clear 100 unique stages and test your racing skills.<br>Collect super coins to level up and grow your character!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Endless Mode</strong> <br>Keep the challenges going in Infinite Mode.<br>Show off your skills without any limits and dominate the leaderboard! <br>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2785860/extras/levelEditor.png?t=1744401370\" width=800 height=450 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2785860/extras/ae2570b9c0afe3f9d09fe6b91cdc94b8.poster.avif?t=1744401370\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2785860/extras/ae2570b9c0afe3f9d09fe6b91cdc94b8.webm?t=1744401370\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2785860/extras/ae2570b9c0afe3f9d09fe6b91cdc94b8.mp4?t=1744401370\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Build and Share Your Own Levels!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u25a0 Create your own levels with a simple and intuitive level editor.</strong><br>Design race tracks that are nearly impossible to conquer or create the fastest route imaginable.<br>You can even craft challenging puzzles that will push your friends to their limits!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u25a0 Create with the community!</strong><br>Share your custom courses with the community and showcase your creativity.<br>Build your own racing kingdom and become the star of your maps!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2785860/extras/f881e20aa48208b1fbfe2618e29acacb.avif?t=1744401370\" width=650 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2785860/extras/b0748acd208fd3a9c16575997359ff57.poster.avif?t=1744401370\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2785860/extras/b0748acd208fd3a9c16575997359ff57.webm?t=1744401370\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2785860/extras/b0748acd208fd3a9c16575997359ff57.mp4?t=1744401370\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Race with Style</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover your favorite among a cast of vibrant and distinctive characters that can change the game.<br>Experiment with different Runners or master a single one to showcase your true skill. <br>Receive rewards based on your mastery level and unlock exclusive character skins for each one.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Neon Runners: Craft and Dash</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Neon Runners: Craft &amp; Dash \u2013 The Ultimate Racing &amp; Running Game!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get ready for an action-packed racing with simple controls!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compete in fast-paced running races, conquer stages, and defeat monsters in a thrilling sprint to victory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unleash your creativity in the Level Maker, share your designs, and challenge the world to fun, neon infused races!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2785860/extras/battleRacing.png?t=1744401370\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2785860/extras/34f5f3af4842c1c94ecc0fff996ce952.poster.avif?t=1744401370\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2785860/extras/34f5f3af4842c1c94ecc0fff996ce952.webm?t=1744401370\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2785860/extras/34f5f3af4842c1c94ecc0fff996ce952.mp4?t=1744401370\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is the core mode that defines <i>Neon Runners</i>: Four enter, but only one emerges victorious. Race against three opponents, each equipped with powerful abilities, and be the first to reach the goal. The courses are filled with game-changing power-ups and gimmicks that add excitement\u2014or chaos\u2014to the competition.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2785860/extras/762f2b2ed280293be96b6cb034857237.avif?